<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Coates says yr profit matches forecast.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Coates says yr profit matches forecast.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equipment hire group Coates Hire Ltd said on Tuesday its 1995/96 net profit was A$10.4 million, in line with the company's listing prospectus.</p>
<p>The company, formerly a unit of Australian National Industries Ltd, was floated on August 6.</p>
<p>Profit before interest and tax was also in line with the prospectus, rising 10.9 percent to A19.3 million.</p>
<p>Hire sales rose 5.5 percent to A$113.3 million, above the forecast level of A$112.8 million.  </p>
<p>The company said its operating profit of A$16.1 million was A$150,000 lower than forecast due to an unexpected insurance charge of the same amount.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
